{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fragments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fragments</i> is a <strong>first-person psychological horror</strong> game with a focus on<strong> puzzles and narrative</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve mind-bending puzzles</strong> as you uncover fragments of your shattered memory. But beware, you\u2019re not alone. Your inner tormentors are always one step behind, trying to keep you from the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fragments of the Past</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>9 memory fragments</strong>, each tied to one of <strong>3 traumatic periods</strong> in your life. Every fragment reveals a piece of your forgotten past and brings you closer to confronting what you\u2019ve buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each memory fragment comes with its <strong>own type of puzzle</strong>, tailored to the trauma it represents. No two are the same. Think carefully, and move fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Maze-like Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore twisted, maze-like environments that reflect your inner turmoil, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, suffocating forest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An eerie underground hotel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunting, memory-soaked house</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is tied to a specific traumatic part of your life that contains a total of 3 memory fragments in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face Your Tormentors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, hide, or fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>inner tormentors</strong> are relentless. They will do everything they can to stop you from recovering your memories. Survive and confront the veil that shrouds your memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Does the Game Offer?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>Multiple paths</strong> to complete your playthrough</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>High replayability</strong> \u2013 complete <strong>3 unique runs</strong> to collect all 9 fragments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>2\u20134 hours of playtime</strong> depending on your choices and skill</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>Challenging, original puzzles</strong> tied to memory and trauma</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>Can you survive your own mind and face the truth you tried to forget?</strong> \ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assets Included in the Steam Capsules:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Bloodied Mask&quot; by Koyshem available on Sketchfab under CC:BY 4.0 (Changed Texture)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;State Park Sign&quot; by austinstanbury available on Sketchfab under CC:BY 4.0 (Changed Texture)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4003260?t=1767970642","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003260/deeff8b91ebf6a856dc189b6f1e76c2092f02522/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767970642","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003260/6d2c3801dd69ace252142632b058d83a06be4018/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=176797064