e Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore twisted, maze-like environments that reflect your inner turmoil, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, suffocating forest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An eerie underground hotel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunting, memory-soaked house</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is tied to a specific traumatic part of your life that contains a total of 3 memory fragments in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face Your Tormentors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, hide, or fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>inner tormentors</strong> are relentless. They will do everything they can to stop you from recovering your memories. Survive and confront the veil that shrouds your memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Does the Game Offer?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>Multiple paths</strong> to complete your playthrough</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>High replayability</strong> \u2013 complete <strong>3 unique runs</strong> to collect all 9 fragments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>2\u20134 hours of playtime</strong> depending on your choices and skill</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>Challenging, original puzzles</strong> tied to memory and trauma</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>Can you survive your own mind and face the truth you tried to forget?</strong> \ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assets Included in the Steam Capsules:</p><p class=\"bb_paragr